  "notes": [
    "hash_to_point = RistrettoPoint::from_uniform_bytes(SHA-512(utf8(phone))). No DST, not RFC 9380.",
    "server secret k = Scalar::from_bytes_mod_order_wide(HKDF-SHA512(ikm=root, info=\"sanchr-oprf-epoch-v1\" || epoch_le64)).",
    "blinded = compress(r * H(phone)); evaluated = compress(k * decompress(blinded)); unblinded = compress(r^-1 * decompress(evaluated)).",
    "set_element = compress(k * H(phone)); the protocol holds iff unblinded == set_element.",
    "All *_hex fields are 32 bytes. On the wire they are raw protobuf bytes, never hex."
